flowchart TD
    subgraph Pipeline["RegistrationPipeline (orchestrator)"]
        direction TB
        P1[PermissionCheckHandler]
        P2[RegistrationPeriodHandler]
        P3[CapacityCheckHandler]
        P4[ScheduleConflictHandler]
        P5[EnrollmentHandler]

        P1 -->|pass| P2
        P2 -->|pass| P3
        P3 -->|pass| P4
        P4 -->|pass| P5
    end

    RC[RegisterCommand] -->|new PipelineContext\nstudent + section| Pipeline

    P1 -->|fail: no permission| PR1[PipelineResult\nfailed at: PermissionCheck\nerror message]
    P2 -->|fail: reg. closed| PR2[PipelineResult\nfailed at: PeriodCheck\nerror message]
    P3 -->|fail: section full| PR3[PipelineResult\nfailed at: CapacityCheck\nerror message]
    P4 -->|fail: time overlap| PR4[PipelineResult\nfailed at: ConflictCheck\nconflicting section name\nconflicting days + times]
    P5 -->|success| PR5[PipelineResult\npassed \nnew Enrollment created]

PR1 & PR2 & PR3 & PR4 -->|enrollment aborted| RC
PR5 -->|enrollment persisted| RC

subgraph ConflictCheck["ScheduleConflictHandler detail"]
direction LR
SC1[get student's\ncurrent enrollments] --> SC2[for each Enrollment\nget SectionMeetingTimes]
SC2 --> SC3{any day + time\noverlap with\nnew section?}
SC3 -->|yes| SC4[return conflicting\nSection object]
SC3 -->|no| SC5[pass to next handler]
end

P4 -.->|zoom in| ConflictCheck